{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人麥浚龍（Juno）向來喜歡黑白美學，對生活品味要求極高，但近日發生一件事令他嬲到「七彩」。</p><p>Juno日前在社交網限時動態貼圖發文，公開點名一家國際空運公司，怒斥對方的服務品質極度惡劣，引起網民熱議。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;g</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T04:00:57.627481+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":113,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T03:29:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:12.862387+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:58:12.862387+00:00","content_hash":"892a9fa601ccab5f85bc7c9ea8e24b6f824d83f5cfa221412b8f45f68ce2c822","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}